      "rationale": "Categorizing the problem type from short_description gives a genuine grouping axis to compare resolution efficiency across issue types. Values (printer, connectivity, database) are sound readings of the source descriptions. Somewhat overlaps with the existing 'category' column but adds finer granularity."
