      "source_groundedness": 0.4,
      "hallucination_observed": false,
      "rationale": "The column is constant (false for all 500 rows), providing zero discriminative power for the analysis. A near-constant column adds no analytical leverage. Groundedness is moot but the uniform 'false' may reflect a failure to actually compute turnover from closed_by vs assigned_to rather than a true reading."
    },
    {
      "name": "inter_update_delay_signal",
      "analytical_usefulness": 0.8,
